# {{lb|id|arithmetic}} {{l|en|numerator}} and {{l|en|denominator}}.
#: {{hyponyms|id|pembilang|penyebut}}
# {{l|en|clan}}: a group of people all descended from a common ancestor, in fact or belief.
#: {{syn|id|suku sakat|klan}}
# {{l|en|ethnicity}}, {{l|en|ethnic group}}: a group of people who identify with one another, especially on the basis of ancestral, national, cultural, historical or religious grounds.
#: {{syn|id|etnis|suku bangsa}}
# {{lb|id|biology|taxonomy}} {{l|en|family}}: a category in the classification of organisms, ranking below order and above genus; a taxon at that rank.
#: {{syn|id|famili}}
# {{lb|id|mathematics}} {{l|en|term}}: any value (variable or constant) or expression separated from another term by a space or an appropriate character, in an overall expression or table.
# {{lb|id|Jambi|Palembang}} A traditional unit of gold weight, equal  six point seven [[grams]].

